    "Materialize writes 988,097,824 B per checkpoint. The pipeline overlaps decode with that write; it cannot make the write itself faster.",
    "pipeline.decode_wall_ms is the wall time until the last decode finished; decode_sum_ms (in the run JSONs) is the sum of worker busy time and can exceed it. transfer_ms is the writer waiting for the next in-order result; write_ms is time inside write_all.",
