    "The disk (host bind mount) rows are NOT a performance claim: across 1 repetitions the same batched 988 MB materialize ranged 4923.524 to 13368.842 ms and the pipeline total ranged 1437.017 to 15038.131 ms, a host writeback spread larger than any mode difference. The tmpfs rows are the controlled comparison.",
